{
  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Lab 6 — CampusWeather Panel"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "# Lab 6 — `CampusWeather` Dashboard Panel\n\nA **Panel** (`DEFINE PANEL`) is a live operator dashboard defined in LoT and rendered inside the HUB's **Dashboards** window. It subscribes directly to your MQTT topics — no frontend code required.\n\n### What this Panel creates\n- A 12-column responsive `GRID` layout.\n- Three **`STAT` cards** across the top row (`SPAN 4` each = 12 columns) showing **Temperature (°C)**, **Temperature (°F)**, and **Wind Speed (km/h)**.\n- One **`BADGE` indicator** on the second row (`SPAN 4`) showing **Heat Alert** (`on` in red vs. `off` in green).\n\n### Deploy and view your dashboard\n1. Click **▷** on the code cell below.\n2. Open **Dashboards** from the **bottom Dock** and click **Campus Weather**.\n3. If any card shows `--`, open **Data Viewer → Publish** and send `poll` to `campus/weather/request` to push a fresh reading."
    },
    {
      "kind": 2,
      "language": "lot",
      "value": "DEFINE PANEL CampusWeather\n    WITH TITLE \"Campus Weather\"\n    WITH DESCRIPTION \"Live readings from the campus station\"\n    WITH ICON \"cloud-sun\"\n    WITH DENSITY \"comfortable\"\n    WITH REFRESH 5\n\n    LAYOUT USING GRID WITH COLUMNS 12\n\n        SECTION \"Current Conditions\" WITH ICON \"thermometer\" COLLAPSIBLE FALSE\n\n            WIDGET \"Temperature (°C)\" AS STAT\n                WITH SOURCE TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading/temperature_c\"\n                WITH UNIT \"°C\"\n                WITH DECIMALS 1\n                WITH COLOR \"#f97316\"\n                WITH ICON \"thermometer\"\n                WITH SPAN 4\n\n            WIDGET \"Temperature (°F)\" AS STAT\n                WITH SOURCE TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading/temperature_f\"\n                WITH UNIT \"°F\"\n                WITH DECIMALS 1\n                WITH COLOR \"#fb923c\"\n                WITH ICON \"thermometer\"\n                WITH SPAN 4\n\n            WIDGET \"Wind Speed\" AS STAT\n                WITH SOURCE TOPIC \"campus/weather/reading/wind_kmh\"\n                WITH UNIT \"km/h\"\n                WITH DECIMALS 1\n                WITH COLOR \"#38bdf8\"\n                WITH ICON \"wind\"\n                WITH SPAN 4\n\n        SECTION \"Alerts\" WITH ICON \"bell\" COLLAPSIBLE FALSE\n\n            WIDGET \"Heat Alert\" AS BADGE\n                WITH SOURCE TOPIC \"campus/weather/alerts/heat_active\"\n                WITH ICON \"flame\"\n                WITH SPAN 4\n                WITH MAPPING\n                    WHEN \"on\" LABEL \"HEAT ALERT\" COLOR \"#ef4444\"\n                    WHEN \"off\" LABEL \"Normal\" COLOR \"#22c55e\"\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": 1,
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "**Congratulations!** You have built the entire Campus Weather Station pipeline end to end.\n\nWant to go further? Open **`07-stretch.lotnb`** in the left sidebar for 6 optional stretch challenges!"
    }
  ]
}
